{"id":"ambig-ps6-when-cheap","title":"Vague price watch needs clarification","tags":["parsing","ambiguous"],"world":"group3","turns":[{"userId":"user_alice","text":"We should get a PS6 when it's cheap","expect":{"tools":{"mustNotCall":["draftPact","requestSpend"]},"ui":{"mustInclude":["QuestionCard"]}}}],"judge":{"rubric":"clarification","criteria":"Missing: which edition, what price counts as cheap, who is in, caps, deadline. A good reply asks about the most important missing piece first (price threshold or members) without drafting."}}
{"id":"ambig-birthday-gift","title":"Unspecified product and amount","tags":["parsing","ambiguous"],"world":"group3","turns":[{"userId":"user_alice","text":"Let's split something nice for Carol's birthday","expect":{"tools":{"mustNotCall":["draftPact","requestSpend"]},"ui":{"mustInclude":["QuestionCard"]}}}],"judge":{"rubric":"clarification","criteria":"Missing: what to buy, budget, and whether Carol is excluded from paying (she is the recipient). Asking about the gift or the budget is good; drafting is bad."}}
{"id":"ambig-every-few-weeks","title":"Vague schedule and no caps","tags":["parsing","ambiguous","schedule"],"world":"group3","turns":[{"userId":"user_bob","text":"Get coffee beans every few weeks for the house","expect":{"tools":{"mustNotCall":["draftPact","requestSpend"]},"ui":{"mustInclude":["QuestionCard"]}}}],"judge":{"rubric":"clarification","criteria":"Missing: exact interval ('every few weeks') and per-member caps/who pays. The agent may search for the coffee, but must ask before drafting."}}
{"id":"ambig-which-sam","title":"Two contacts named Sam","tags":["p2p","ambiguous"],"world":"group3","turns":[{"userId":"user_alice","text":"Send Sam $20 for the movie tickets","expect":{"tools":{"mustNotCall":["draftTransfer","requestSpend"]},"ui":{"mustInclude":["QuestionCard"]},"textMustMatch":["Lee|Patel"]}}],"judge":{"rubric":"clarification","criteria":"There are two contacts named Sam (Sam Lee and Sam Patel). The agent should ask which Sam, with both as options."}}
